  "text-17px": "Gain in efficiency with Combo: create and share your schedules in just a few minutes, manage your payroll and analyze your ratios with complete peace of mind.",
  "logo-integration-inner-hero-src": "/assets/cdn.prod.website-files.com/63f501f2fcfc599ea419f99b/665dd8509ad071fb9c1f5b61_combo%20hero.avif",
